@ codes, selected index, first visible row -> rewrites only the codes of the
@ visible home rows (new 30 s window): six small GROBs, nothing else redrawn
\<< \-> codes sel top
  \<<
    top top 4 + ACCTS SIZE MIN FOR k
      codes k GET FMT7 2 \->GROB
      IF k sel == THEN NEG END
      PICT k top - 8 * 12 + R\->B #87d SWAP 2 \->LIST ROT REPL
    NEXT
  \>>
\>>
